# viewer-wordmark-click (h10-page): the viewer on func=x2&a=2; the wordmark's
# centre ((104, 48) on the viewer's top bar) navigates home; the shot 2 s
# later: the welcome page. Behaviour: the route and url lines.
# Phase 1 reaches the viewer with a mid-run hash edit (no `route` line yet);
# phase 2 opens it with one (h10-t-route).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
hash func=x2&a=2
wait 500
click 104 48
wait 2000
shot viewer-wordmark-click
